{"attribution":"Federal Emergency Management Agency, Ready.gov, Drought, Simplified Chinese; no FEMA, DHS, or U.S. Government endorsement or affiliation is implied.","cases":[{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-drought-zh-hans-v1/sentence-001","input":"美国几乎每个地区都会经历降雨减少的时期。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/drought","source_case_id":"sentence-001","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-drought-zh-hans-v1/sentence-002","input":"提前做好干旱防备计划能在干旱年份提供保护。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/drought","source_case_id":"sentence-002","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-drought-zh-hans-v1/sentence-003","input":"防备干旱的最好方法就是节水。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/drought","source_case_id":"sentence-003","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-drought-zh-hans-v1/sentence-004","input":"在日常生活中习惯节水。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/drought","source_case_id":"sentence-004","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-drought-zh-hans-v1/sentence-005","input":"还能作他用时，切勿将水倒入下水道，例如，可用来浇灌室内植物或花园。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/drought","source_case_id":"sentence-005","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-drought-zh-hans-v1/sentence-006","input":"更换垫圈，修复滴水的水龙头。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/drought","source_case_id":"sentence-006","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-drought-zh-hans-v1/sentence-007","input":"每秒漏一滴水，每年就会浪费 2,700 加仑水。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/drought","source_case_id":"sentence-007","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-drought-zh-hans-v1/sentence-008","input":"检查所有管道是否漏水，请管道工修理任何漏水的管道。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/drought","source_case_id":"sentence-008","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-drought-zh-hans-v1/sentence-009","input":"安装带限流器的起泡器，改装家中所有水龙头。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/drought","source_case_id":"sentence-009","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-drought-zh-hans-v1/sentence-010","input":"在水槽上安装即时热水器。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/drought","source_case_id":"sentence-010","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-drought-zh-hans-v1/sentence-011","input":"将水管绝缘，减少热量损失，防止破裂。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/drought","source_case_id":"sentence-011","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-drought-zh-hans-v1/sentence-012","input":"仅在水中矿物质会损坏管道时才安装软水系统。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/drought","source_case_id":"sentence-012","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-drought-zh-hans-v1/sentence-013","input":"度假时关掉软水机。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/drought","source_case_id":"sentence-013","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-drought-zh-hans-v1/sentence-014","input":"选择效率更高、性能更佳的设备。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/drought","source_case_id":"sentence-014","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-drought-zh-hans-v1/sentence-015","input":"考虑购买小容量马桶，用水量不到旧型号的一半。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/drought","source_case_id":"sentence-015","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-drought-zh-hans-v1/sentence-016","input":"安装马桶排水装置，减少冲洗所需水量。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/drought","source_case_id":"sentence-016","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-drought-zh-hans-v1/sentence-017","input":"在水箱中放一个一加仑的塑料水罐取代马桶水流。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/drought","source_case_id":"sentence-017","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-drought-zh-hans-v1/sentence-018","input":"确保不会干扰马桶操作部件。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/drought","source_case_id":"sentence-018","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-drought-zh-hans-v1/sentence-019","input":"使用超低流量的淋浴喷头。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/drought","source_case_id":"sentence-019","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-drought-zh-hans-v1/sentence-020","input":"不要使用垃圾处理器，将食物扔进垃圾箱或堆肥堆处理。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/drought","source_case_id":"sentence-020","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-drought-zh-hans-v1/sentence-021","input":"如果自动泵不用水时会打开和关闭，则说明在漏水。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/drought","source_case_id":"sentence-021","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-drought-zh-hans-v1/sentence-022","input":"种植当地和/或耐旱的青草、地被、灌木和树木，长成后无需太多浇水。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/drought","source_case_id":"sentence-022","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-drought-zh-hans-v1/sentence-023","input":"按用水量分开种。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/drought","source_case_id":"sentence-023","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-drought-zh-hans-v1/sentence-024","input":"除非使用循环再用水，否则不要安装装饰性水景（如喷泉）。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/drought","source_case_id":"sentence-024","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-drought-zh-hans-v1/sentence-025","input":"可行时考虑收集雨水。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/drought","source_case_id":"sentence-025","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-drought-zh-hans-v1/sentence-026","input":"联系当地供水商获取信息和协助。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/drought","source_case_id":"sentence-026","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-drought-zh-hans-v1/sentence-027","input":"放置洒水器时，要让水洒落在草坪和灌木上，而非铺砌的地方。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/drought","source_case_id":"sentence-027","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-drought-zh-hans-v1/sentence-028","input":"修好喷出细雾的洒水器。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/drought","source_case_id":"sentence-028","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-drought-zh-hans-v1/sentence-029","input":"定期检查自动洒水系统和计时装置，确保能正常运行。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/drought","source_case_id":"sentence-029","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-drought-zh-hans-v1/sentence-030","input":"将割草机刀片升高到至少三英寸或最高水平。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/drought","source_case_id":"sentence-030","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-drought-zh-hans-v1/sentence-031","input":"割草时留得更高，草根就能长得更深，留住更多土壤水分。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/drought","source_case_id":"sentence-031","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-drought-zh-hans-v1/sentence-032","input":"种植抗旱的草种。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/drought","source_case_id":"sentence-032","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-drought-zh-hans-v1/sentence-033","input":"减少或消除不常用的草坪。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/drought","source_case_id":"sentence-033","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-drought-zh-hans-v1/sentence-034","input":"草坪不要过度施肥，施肥越多，用水越多。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/drought","source_case_id":"sentence-034","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-drought-zh-hans-v1/sentence-035","input":"施用含有不溶于水的缓释氮肥。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/drought","source_case_id":"sentence-035","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-drought-zh-hans-v1/sentence-036","input":"为树木、灌木和花卉选择节水灌溉系统（如滴灌）。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/drought","source_case_id":"sentence-036","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-drought-zh-hans-v1/sentence-037","input":"秋冬两季仅在需要时手动浇水。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/drought","source_case_id":"sentence-037","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-drought-zh-hans-v1/sentence-038","input":"在树木和植物周围使用护根物，不但能保留土壤中的水分，还有助于控制与植物争水的杂草。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/drought","source_case_id":"sentence-038","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-drought-zh-hans-v1/sentence-039","input":"购买天气或智能灌溉控制器。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/drought","source_case_id":"sentence-039","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-drought-zh-hans-v1/sentence-040","input":"这些设备能根据土壤湿度、雨水、风力及蒸发和蒸腾速率自动调整浇水时间和频率。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/drought","source_case_id":"sentence-040","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-drought-zh-hans-v1/sentence-041","input":"询问当地水务机构，看看购买智能控制器是否有折扣。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/drought","source_case_id":"sentence-041","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-drought-zh-hans-v1/sentence-042","input":"安装泳池节水过滤器。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/drought","source_case_id":"sentence-042","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-drought-zh-hans-v1/sentence-043","input":"使用传统过滤器时，一次反冲洗就要用 180 到 250 加仑水。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/drought","source_case_id":"sentence-043","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-drought-zh-hans-v1/sentence-044","input":"盖好泳池和水疗设备，减少水蒸发。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/drought","source_case_id":"sentence-044","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-drought-zh-hans-v1/sentence-045","input":"在干旱期间，务必遵守州府和地方的用水限制。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/drought","source_case_id":"sentence-045","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-drought-zh-hans-v1/sentence-046","input":"联系州府或当地政府，了解最新信息和建议。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/drought","source_case_id":"sentence-046","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-drought-zh-hans-v1/sentence-047","input":"将纸巾、昆虫和其他类似废物放入垃圾桶，而非马桶。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/drought","source_case_id":"sentence-047","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-drought-zh-hans-v1/sentence-048","input":"短时间洗淋浴，而非泡澡。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/drought","source_case_id":"sentence-048","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-drought-zh-hans-v1/sentence-049","input":"只在湿身和用皂时打开水，然后再打开水洗净。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/drought","source_case_id":"sentence-049","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-drought-zh-hans-v1/sentence-050","input":"刷牙、洗脸或剃须时，不要让水不停地流。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/drought","source_case_id":"sentence-050","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-drought-zh-hans-v1/sentence-051","input":"洗衣机装满了衣服再洗，按衣服的多少设置水位。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/drought","source_case_id":"sentence-051","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-drought-zh-hans-v1/sentence-052","input":"自动洗碗机装满了再洗。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/drought","source_case_id":"sentence-052","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-drought-zh-hans-v1/sentence-053","input":"使用“轻洗”功能，减少用水量。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/drought","source_case_id":"sentence-053","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-drought-zh-hans-v1/sentence-054","input":"手动洗碗时，用两个容器放满水，一个放肥皂水，另一个放含少量氯漂白剂的漂洗水。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/drought","source_case_id":"sentence-054","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-drought-zh-hans-v1/sentence-055","input":"洗菜时用装满水的平底锅，而非水龙头流出的自来水。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/drought","source_case_id":"sentence-055","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-drought-zh-hans-v1/sentence-056","input":"等待水龙头的水变热时，不要让水流掉。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/drought","source_case_id":"sentence-056","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-drought-zh-hans-v1/sentence-057","input":"接住用作他用（如植物浇水），或在炉子上或微波炉中加热。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/drought","source_case_id":"sentence-057","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-drought-zh-hans-v1/sentence-058","input":"放入洗碗机前不要冲洗盘子，只需拿掉大粒的食物。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/drought","source_case_id":"sentence-058","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-drought-zh-hans-v1/sentence-059","input":"勿用流水解冻肉类或其他冷冻食品。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/drought","source_case_id":"sentence-059","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-drought-zh-hans-v1/sentence-060","input":"放在冰箱中过夜解冻，或使用微波炉的解冻设置。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/drought","source_case_id":"sentence-060","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-drought-zh-hans-v1/sentence-061","input":"大雨过后，两周内都不需要浇水。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/drought","source_case_id":"sentence-061","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-drought-zh-hans-v1/sentence-062","input":"一年中大部分时间，草坪每周只需一英寸水。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/drought","source_case_id":"sentence-062","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-drought-zh-hans-v1/sentence-063","input":"用土壤探头、铁锹或大螺丝刀检查土壤水分含量。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/drought","source_case_id":"sentence-063","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-drought-zh-hans-v1/sentence-064","input":"如果土壤仍然潮湿，则无需浇水。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/drought","source_case_id":"sentence-064","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-drought-zh-hans-v1/sentence-065","input":"踩着时会弹回来，草坪就不需要水。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/drought","source_case_id":"sentence-065","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-drought-zh-hans-v1/sentence-066","input":"如果确实需要浇水，应在温度较低的清晨或傍晚浇水。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/drought","source_case_id":"sentence-066","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-drought-zh-hans-v1/sentence-067","input":"要让草坪能更好地吸收水分并避免径流，分几次短时间浇水，而非一次长时间浇水。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/drought","source_case_id":"sentence-067","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-drought-zh-hans-v1/sentence-068","input":"在车道或人行道上清洁树叶和其他碎屑时，应使用扫帚或鼓风机，而非水管。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/drought","source_case_id":"sentence-068","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-drought-zh-hans-v1/sentence-069","input":"使用洒水器或水管时，一定要有人看着。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/drought","source_case_id":"sentence-069","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-drought-zh-hans-v1/sentence-070","input":"一根花园水管几个小时就能流出至少 600 加仑水。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/drought","source_case_id":"sentence-070","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-drought-zh-hans-v1/sentence-071","input":"极度干旱时，让草坪枯死，保住树木和大灌木。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/drought","source_case_id":"sentence-071","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-drought-zh-hans-v1/sentence-072","input":"使用利用回收水的商用洗车场。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/drought","source_case_id":"sentence-072","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-drought-zh-hans-v1/sentence-073","input":"自己洗车时，使用可将水管调至精细喷雾的开关水枪。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/drought","source_case_id":"sentence-073","split":"article"}}],"converter_output_used":false,"dataset":"blind-v2","id":"ready-gov-drought-zh-hans-v1","input_only":true,"license":"U.S. Public Domain","modification_notice":"Extracted only complete Simplified Chinese paragraph and list-item sentences from the checksum-pinned Ready.gov main element, removed navigation, images, external resources, phone/URL instructions, page furniture, and exact duplicates, and added input-only provenance; no expected text or converter output was used.","purpose":"candidate_source_pilot","review_policy":"domain_and_risk_must_be_assigned_from_input_only","source_class":"public_domain","stats":{"by_split":{"article":73},"eligible_pending_review":73,"exclusions":{},"raw_cases":73},"upstream_revision":"Ready.gov Simplified Chinese Drought; page last updated 2025-10-31; retrieved HTML SHA-256: 2693df3ef41f485ca656735612a13beab3f581947480c845eaff32ca12cdf730","version":1}
